{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"container med post-content\">\n<figure class=\"img-border featured-image\">\n<img>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple unleashed a collection of next-generation products this month, from the new <a href=\"https://amzn.to/46V28kv\">AirPods 5</a> and <a href=\"https://amzn.to/46SynAU\">Beats 360 ANC headphones</a> (last day for the <a href=\"https://amzn.to/3VavY21\">launch discount</a>), the <a href=\"https://amzn.to/4hv7vM3\">Apple Watch Series 12</a> and <a href=\"https://amzn.to/4rNPg9C\">Ultra 4</a>, right through to the latest M6-powered <a href=\"https://amzn.to/4dhyidI\">Mac mini</a> and <a href=\"https://amzn.to/47u3iDK\">Mac Studio</a>. All of which are accompanied by a series of new accessories. </p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Amazon is also carrying over a <a href=\"https://amzn.to/4Ay8nbw\">number of launch discounts</a> on some of them courtesy of its <a href=\"https://amzn.to/4yejpAB\">early fall Prime Day sale</a> for folks looking to jump in now, and we have collected all of them for you below. </p>\n<span id=\"more-1072147\"></span>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-airpods-5\">AirPods 5</h2>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>AirPods 5 with ANC <a href=\"https://amzn.to/4dOC1zx\"><strong>$129</strong></a></li>\n<li>AirPods 5 with Wireless Charging Case <strong><a href=\"https://amzn.to/4yr9mJf\">$149</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-beats-360\">Beats 360</h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em><strong>***Note: </strong>Today is the last day to score 80% off the Beats 360 Cushion Kit</em></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-apple-watch-series-12\">Apple Watch Series 12</h2>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-apple-watch-ultra-4\"